<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><link rel="stylesheet" href="{{.Assets}}/css/06c0f1263d868f78.css"><title>古平町観光協会</title><meta name="description" content="北海道古平町の観光情報サイト"><meta name="application-name" content="古平観光"><link rel="manifest" href="/meta/site.webmanifest"><meta name="generator" content="v0.dev"><meta property="og:title" content="古平町観光協会 | 熱く燃ゆる町"><meta property="og:description" content="北海道古平町の観光情報サイト。天狗の火渡りや新鮮な海産物、温泉、宿泊施設など、古平町の魅力的な観光スポットをご紹介します。"><meta property="og:url" content="https://furubira-kanko.com"><meta property="og:site_name" content="古平町観光協会"><meta property="og:locale" content="ja_JP"><meta property="og:image" content="https://furubira-kanko.com/meta/ogp.jpg"><meta property="og:image:width" content="1200"><meta property="og:image:height" content="630"><meta property="og:image:alt" content="OGP Image"><meta property="og:type" content="website"><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"><meta name="twitter:site" content="@furubira_enjoy"><meta name="twitter:title" content="古平町観光協会"><meta name="twitter:description" content="北海道古平町の観光情報サイト"><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://furubira-kanko.com/meta/ogp.jpg"><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico?88dfb7f9683f6a4b" type="image/x-icon" sizes="48x48"><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico"><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml"><link rel="icon" href="/favicon-96x96.png" type="image/png" sizes="96x96"><link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/meta/apple-touch-icon.png"><link rel="canonical" href="https://furubira-kanko.com/en/access"><link rel="alternate" hreflang="ja" href="https://furubira-kanko.com/ja/access"><link rel="alternate" hreflang="en" href="https://furubira-kanko.com/en/access"><script>try{let t=localStorage.getItem("theme")||"light";if(t==="system")t=matchMedia("(prefers-color-scheme: dark)").matches?"dark":"light";document.documentElement.classList.add(t);document.